  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A high school girl, Rai, secretly has a crush on her childhood friend, Do-gyeong.\r\nTo hide her feelings, she pretends to be an idol fan.\r\n\r\nJust when she couldn't give up on either her one-sided love or her fangirling—her favorite idol transfers to her school?!\r\nWith Neulchan’s transfer, the relationship that seemed unchangeable begins to shake.\r\n\r\n\"We're just friends, so why are you jealous?\"\r\n\r\nA summer-lit school romance about a childhood friend turning into a girlfriend!"
  },
